<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets 100 million rand Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets 100 million rand Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.25     MATURITY    18.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.91    PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMANY   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/GB/DE/ZA/N.ANTILLES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
